  "Adept Academy": "Adept Academy",
  "Adequate facilities and a real training address, P.O. Boxes are not accepted.": "充足的设施与真实的培训地址，邮政信箱不予接受。",
  "Administration Systems": "行政系统",
  "Adult Educator": "成人教育者",
  "Adult educators assigned to the course must be registered with the National Adult Educator Registry, managed by the Institute for Adult Learning at the Singapore University of Social Sciences.": "分配到课程的成人教育者，必须在全国成人教育者注册名录中登记，该名录由Singapore University of Social Sciences的成人学习学院管理。",
