  "Aim far.": "志向高远。",
  "Aim for the skies, and one day you look down from them. The sky belongs to whoever learns to reach it, not only to those who could afford the view.": "以苍穹为志，终有一天你会从空中俯瞰。天空属于每一个学会抵达它的人，而不只属于那些本就买得起这片风景的人。",
  "Air Transport": "航空运输",
  "Alignment of courseware": "课件的对齐校准",
  "All information is held in confidence and used only to assess fit.": "所有信息均予保密，仅用于评估契合度。",
  "All rights reserved.": "版权所有。",
  "An IAL recognition for adult educators with deep specialist skill. Written IAL-SAE where the institute confers it.": "一项由IAL授予、面向具备深厚专业技能的成人教育者的认可。在该学院授予时写作IAL-SAE。",
  "An advanced credential for curriculum developers and adult educators, above ACTA and ACLP.": "一项面向课程开发人员与成人教育者的高级资历，其层级高于ACTA与ACLP。",
  "An annual campaign plan": "一份年度活动计划",
  "An arch holds quietly because every stone is set in its right place. A community of practitioners works the same way, matched to the project, no more, no less.": "拱券之所以静静矗立，是因为每一块石头都各安其位。实践者社群的运作亦然：与项目相配，不多，不少。",
  "An eligibility check is run at enquiry, a course-fit conversation is held before any deposit is taken, and a thirty-day post-course check-in is tied to the trainer's continuing development. Every conversation is logged. The same script handles both pre and post.": "在咨询阶段进行资格核查，在收取任何订金之前进行课程契合度的交谈，并有一次为期三十天的课后回访，与培训师的持续发展挂钩。每一次交谈都有记录。同一套话术同时应对课前与课后。",
  "An onboarded register of trainers carries credentials, course matches, observation records and continuing professional development. It is renewed annually, audited at every TPQA, and prepared before every cohort.": "一份已完成入职登记的培训师名录，载有资历、课程匹配、观课记录与持续专业发展。它每年更新，在每次TPQA时接受审计，并在每一批学员开班之前备妥。",
  "And the Rules of Evidence, applied to the actual assessment instruments in use, not the ones submitted at approval.": "以及证据规则，套用于实际使用中的评估工具，而非审批时提交的那些。",
  "And the line is no longer only a rule of conduct. The TPQA item covering the management of marketing activities was updated with effect from 1 December 2025, which means your marketing governance, claim substantiation and publishing discipline are now read at audit alongside your courseware. Marketing built carelessly is no longer merely ineffective; it is an audit finding waiting to be written.": "而这条界线已不再仅仅是一项行为准则。TPQA中涵盖营销活动管理的项目已自2025年12月1日起更新，这意味着您的营销治理、声称佐证与发布规范，如今会在审计时与您的课件一同被审阅。草率打造的营销不再只是收效甚微；它是一条尚待写下的审计发现。",
  "And the next mandate": "以及下一份委托",
  "Any organisation that wants to offer SWDA-funded courses for the first time must pass through Organisation Registration (OR) on TPGateway, and the application is reviewed together with a first Course Application (CA). The two stand or fall as a pair, which is why we always prepare them on the same working schedule.": "任何想要首次开办SWDA资助课程的机构，都必须通过TPGateway上的机构注册（OR），而该申请会与首份课程申请（CA）一并审核。两者成败与共，正因如此，我们始终按同一套工作时间表来准备它们。",
  "Application via TPGateway": "通过TPGateway提交申请",
