  "Backed by an excellent handout.": "有一份出色的讲义作支撑。",
  "Bahasa Indonesia": "Bahasa Indonesia",
  "Based on the circular published (SSG Information Memorandum QMD/2025/5), from 1 December 2025 onwards, SWDA will disallow RTPs from engaging, requesting or procuring any third party to promote, advertise or market courses. We work together with our clients and prospects to develop in-house strategies for marketing outreach.": "根据已发布的通函（SSG资讯备忘录QMD/2025/5），自2025年12月1日起，SWDA将禁止RTP聘用、要求或安排任何第三方来推广、宣传或营销课程。我们与客户及潜在客户携手，制定内部的营销外展策略。",
  "Beautifully illustrated throughout.": "从头到尾配图精美。",
  "Because CQC reviews the materials a training provider is actually delivering, the work cannot wait until a notification from SWDA arrives. We support training providers across the CQC lifecycle in five ways.": "由于CQC审查的是培训机构实际交付的材料，这项工作不能等到SWDA的通知送达才开始。我们在CQC的整个周期中，以五种方式为培训机构提供支持。",
  "Becoming an SWDA-registered training provider takes months of paperwork, and running one takes discipline every week after. We manage the registration, develop your first course, and run the administration for as long as you need us.": "成为SWDA注册培训机构需要数月的文书工作，而经营一家培训机构则需要此后每一周的自律。我们代为处理注册、开发您的第一门课程，并在您需要我们的期间打理各项行政事务。",
  "Becoming an approved provider": "成为获批机构",
  "Before any curriculum is developed, the course has to qualify for support. SWDA funds a Tier 2 course through one of two routes, and we advise on the right one at scoping. Current as at 1 July 2026.": "在开发任何课程之前，该课程必须先符合资助资格。SWDA通过两条途径之一资助第二级课程，我们会在界定范围时就正确的途径提供建议。信息截至2026年7月1日。",
  "Before the date is set": "在日期确定之前",
  "Before you ask": "在您提问之前",
