  "Big promises are easy to make on a website. These are the three working rules that make ours real, kept on every project without exception.": "在网站上许下宏大承诺很容易。以下三条工作准则让我们的承诺成真，并在每个项目中无一例外地恪守。",
  "BioPharmaceuticals Manufacturing": "生物制药制造",
  "Book a Consultation": "预约咨询",
