  "Book a scoping call": "预约一次范围界定通话",
  "Book the consultation": "预约咨询",
  "Both": "两者皆是",
  "Both are manageable, and neither should be frightening, provided the preparation starts early. That preparation is exactly what this service provides.": "两者都可掌控，只要及早着手准备，都不应令人畏惧。而这份准备，正是本服务所提供的。",
  "Both routes lead to Tier 2 funding, subject to an enrolment cap of 200 places for face-to-face delivery or 350 places online. On reaching the cap, SWDA runs two checks before the funding is renewed.": "两条途径都通向第二级资助，但受报名上限约束：面授200个名额，线上350个名额。达到上限后，SWDA会在续发资助之前进行两项核查。",
  "Brand": "品牌",
  "Brand consistency and claim substantiation. Reduces the marginal cost of acquiring each learner and protects against misrepresentation complaints.": "品牌的一致性与声称的佐证。它降低获取每一名学员的边际成本，并防范失实陈述的投诉。",
