  "CQC": "CQC",
  "CQC is not a one-off exercise. The training providers we support keep their courseware under quarterly review, so that when an SWDA notification does arrive, the materials are already where they need to be.": "CQC并非一次性的功夫。我们所支持的培训机构会让课件保持每季度复审，如此当SWDA的通知真正送达时，材料早已就位。",
  "CQC is typically a document review rather than a site visit. SWDA places greater emphasis on newly approved courses, courses with high enrolment, and courses with weaker TRAQOM performance, and considers whether a training provider has recently undergone TPQA when selecting for the check.": "CQC通常是文件审查，而非现场访视。SWDA更为看重新获批的课程、报名人数众多的课程，以及TRAQOM表现较弱的课程，并在遴选核查对象时，会考量培训机构近期是否经历过TPQA。",
  "CQC was introduced in SWDA Circular QMD/2024/7 and rolled out in phases from January 2025. Where TPQA looks at the training provider in the round, CQC looks at the courseware itself, the Learner Guide, the Trainer Guide, the Lesson Plan and the Assessment Plan as they are actually used in delivery.": "CQC由SWDA通函QMD/2024/7引入，自2025年1月起分阶段推行。TPQA是对培训机构的整体审视，CQC则着眼于课件本身，即实际用于交付的学员指南、培训师指南、教案与评估方案。",
