  "Commercial sustainability. Without it, the training provider is a one-cycle organisation. With it, the operation scales and attracts repeat enterprise work.": "商业上的可持续性。没有它，培训机构便只是一家只此一轮的机构。有了它，运营便能规模化扩展，并吸引回头的企业业务。",
