  "Draw them a small map.": "给他画一张小地图。",
  "Dream big.": "梦想远大。",
  "Dream big. Aim far.": "梦想远大，志向高远。",
  "ECI": "ECI",
  "ESG": "ESG",
  "ESG fundamentals, decarbonisation, climate-related disclosures.": "ESG基础、去碳化、气候相关披露。",
  "Each AE who trains or assesses must hold the WSQ Advanced Certificate in Training and Assessment, the WSQ Advanced Certificate in Learning and Performance (ACLP 2.0), or an equivalent recognised by SWDA at its sole discretion.": "每一位授课或评估的AE，都必须持有WSQ培训与评估高级证书、WSQ学习与绩效高级证书（ACLP 2.0），或SWDA自行酌情认可的同等资格。",
  "Each criterion is also a return on investment.": "每一项标准，同时也是一份投资回报。",
  "Each cycle carries a plan reviewed quarterly, a do tracked in operations, a check at month-end, and an act recorded as a corrective action that is closed at the next review. The cycle is visible at every level of the operation.": "每一个周期都包含：一项每季度复审的“计划”、一项在运营中追踪的“执行”、一项在月末进行的“检查”，以及一项记录为纠正措施、并在下次复审时关闭的“处理”。这一周期在运营的每一个层级都清晰可见。",
  "Each engagement is scoped precisely, priced in writing before work begins, and finished the way it was promised.": "每一项合作都经过精确的范围界定，在工作开始之前以书面形式确定费用，并按承诺如约完成。",
  "Each form has its own route through TPGateway. We prepare a complete and accurate submission, then stay on hand for SWDA's clarifications until the review is closed.": "每一种形式在TPGateway上都有各自的途径。我们准备一份完整而准确的提交材料，随后随时待命，直至SWDA的澄清与审查结束。",
  "Each is an organisation we have worked in, developed for, sat with, or supplied with a developer, an adult educator or a subject-matter expert.": "每一家都是我们曾服务其中、为之开发、与之共坐，或为其提供开发人员、成人教育者或主题专家的机构。",
  "Each project is led by a Level 3 Senior Professional Adult Educator under TAEPP, supported by two curriculum developers accredited under DACE or DDDLP, and by three where the project calls for it. We do not subcontract, and we are glad to introduce you to the people who will be handling your project.": "每个项目均由一位TAEPP框架下的三级资深专业成人教育者主理，并由两位取得DACE或DDDLP认证的课程开发人员提供支持，项目需要时则增至三位。我们从不外包，并乐于向您介绍将负责您项目的团队成员。",
