  "Engage 2birds on the full OR application": "委托2birds办理完整的OR申请",
  "Engaging 2birds is not a way to outsource regulatory accountability. Under the SWDA framework, the obligation to deliver quality training rests, at all times, with the Registered Training Provider. Our work is advisory, and it is intended to leave the training provider better governed than we found it. It falls into four pillars.": "委托2birds并非将监管责任外包的途径。在SWDA框架下，交付优质培训的义务始终归属于注册培训机构。我们的工作属咨询性质，旨在让培训机构在治理上比我们初见时更为完善。它归入四大支柱。",
  "Engineering Services": "工程服务",
  "English": "英语",
  "Enterprise risk, compliance, controls and audit readiness.": "企业风险、合规、内控与审计就绪。",
  "Environmental Services": "环境服务",
  "Environmental, Social and Governance": "环境、社会与治理",
  "Equivalence": "同等资格",
