  "Establishing a new ATO": "设立全新的ATO",
  "Estimated Chargeable Income": "预估应课税收入",
  "Every abbreviation,": "每一个缩略语，",
  "Every abbreviation,spelt out.": "每一个缩略语，逐一详解。",
  "Every artefact carries a version line and change log, and every assessment traces back to the competency map, and from there to the approved Course Application. This is what the Course Quality Check reads for, and what holds a programme together long after the first cohort. Where a project calls for it, marketing collateral is included at no extra charge.": "每一件材料都带有版本行与变更记录，每一项评估都可追溯回能力图谱，再由此追溯至获批的课程申请。这正是课程质量检查所要审阅的，也是在首批学员结课许久之后，仍将一门课程维系成一体的东西。项目有此需要时，营销物料一并附上，不另行收费。",
  "Every commission is shaped to the provider, but these are the pieces we are most often asked to make. Each sits, by design, on the permitted side of the guideline.": "每一份委约都为具体机构量身打造，但以下是我们最常被要求制作的作品。每一件都刻意落在准则所允许的一侧。",
  "Every course begins with someone who wants more.": "每一门课程，都始于一个渴望更多的人。",
  "Every engagement covers the complete set, developed in-house by our own developers and built to satisfy SWDA's approval standards.": "每一项合作都涵盖整套材料，由我们自己的开发人员在内部开发，并按满足SWDA审批标准而构建。",
  "Every engagement is priced as a fixed fee, set out in a written proposal before any work begins. The fee reflects the standard of the work, from accredited developers to two readers on every page, and a firm that stays with the course through approval and audit. We would rather do fewer projects properly than many projects cheaply, and our clients tend to feel the same way.": "每一项合作均以固定费用计价，并在工作开始之前于书面提案中列明。费用体现工作的水准：从取得认证的开发人员，到每一页均有两人审读，再到一家全程陪伴课程走过审批与审计的公司。我们宁愿把较少的项目做好，也不愿以低价承接大量项目，而我们的客户往往也持相同想法。",
  "Every funded course in Singapore takes one of three routes, each asking for different evidence. Choosing the right one is the first decision, and we make it with you before development begins.": "新加坡每一门获资助的课程都会走三条途径之一，每条途径要求的证据各不相同。选对途径是第一个决定，我们会在开发开始之前与您一同作出。",
  "Examinable courses with clear learning outcomes, built for employment or upgrading. To qualify, a course must address an industry skills shortage, must not be an academic degree course, and must meet SWDA's Adult Educator Qualifications Requirements.": "具有明确学习成果、可考核的课程，为就业或技能提升而设。要符合资格，课程必须针对某项行业技能短缺，不得是学术学位课程，并须满足SWDA的成人教育者资格要求。",
  "Examinable programmes accredited under the Workforce Skills Qualifications framework, mapped to the Skills Framework and eligible for Tier 2 funding. Since 1 May 2026, new courses sit within the sharpened WSQ 2.0 scope described below.": "在劳动力技能资格框架下认证、可考核的课程，对应至技能框架，并符合第二级资助资格。自2026年5月1日起，新课程被纳入下文所述、更为聚焦的WSQ 2.0范围。",
  "Explain it to someone out loud.": "大声讲给别人听。",
  "Explaining a route to a friend, you would…": "向朋友解释一条路线，你会……",
