  "First Course Proposal Form and assessment instruments": "首份课程提案表与评估工具",
  "First aid, occupational health, allied health and community care.": "急救、职业健康、专职医疗与社区护理。",
  "First cohort and audit handover": "首批学员与审计交接",
  "First course on TPGateway": "TPGateway上的第一门课程",
  "Focus Learning Centre": "Focus Learning Centre",
  "Follow the written method closely.": "严格照着写下的做法来做。",
