  "Food Services": "餐饮服务",
  "For ATOs already trading. The administrative back office of an ATO is heavier than most organisations expect, and we run it on a retainer or per-project basis.": "面向已在运营的ATO。ATO的行政后台比多数机构预想的更为繁重，我们以聘用制或按项目的方式代为运作。",
  "For TPQA, roughly two months to prepare and submit your documents, with the one-day onsite visit about a month after that. It sounds generous. It is not, if the evidence has to be created rather than collected. The comfortable position is to be ready before the letter exists.": "就TPQA而言，准备并提交文件大约需要两个月，一天的现场访视则在此后约一个月进行。这听起来时间宽裕。可若证据须凭空创建而非收集，便并不宽裕。从容的姿态，是在通知函尚未存在之前便已准备就绪。",
  "For a training organisation, a course earns nothing until it runs, and it runs only when it fills. Every piece we make is built to move a prospective learner one step closer to enrolment, and to turn that enrolment into revenue the business can actually count on.": "对培训机构而言，课程在开办之前分文不赚，而唯有报满才会开办。我们制作的每一件作品，都旨在让潜在学员向报名更近一步，并将这份报名转化为业务真正可以倚靠的营收。",
  "For courses built from the relevant Skills Framework and offered in WSQ or non-WSQ form. The sector's Course Endorsement Body must endorse the proposal before any course application is submitted, and it may request further information before it does. Endorsement is not a guarantee of funding. SWDA makes the final eligibility assessment, audits the application as part of it, and funds an approved course at the 50 or 70 percent support level.": "适用于依据相关技能框架构建、以WSQ或非WSQ形式提供的课程。在提交任何课程申请之前，该行业的课程认可机构必须为提案背书，且在背书之前可要求提供进一步资料。背书并不保证获得资助。SWDA作出最终资格评估，将审计申请作为其中一环，并按50%或70%的资助水平资助获批课程。",
  "For courses built on skills from the register above. No endorsement from a Course Endorsement Body or sector agency is required, and at least half the skills the course delivers must appear on the CASL.": "适用于依据上述名录中的技能而构建的课程。无需课程认可机构或行业主管机构的背书，且课程所传授的技能中，至少有一半须出现在CASL上。",
  "For organisations entering the Training and Adult Education sector for the first time. We sit with you from registration through to your first cohort, preparing each submission the way SWDA expects.": "面向初次进入培训与成人教育行业的机构。我们从注册一路陪伴您直至首批学员开班，并按SWDA所期望的方式准备每一份提交材料。",
  "For organisations new to the sector, this is the requirement most likely to disqualify a fresh application. We sit with you to construct a programme of training that meets the cadence and depth SSG expects, deliver it under the practice's quality framework, and assemble the supporting evidence pack in the form SSG accepts. Where you already have a year of activity, we audit it against SSG's criteria and remediate any gaps before submission.": "对于初入本行业的机构而言，这是最可能导致新申请被否决的要求。我们会与您一同构建一套符合SSG所期望的节奏与深度的培训计划，在本公司的质量框架下交付，并以SSG接受的形式整理支持性证据包。若您已有一年的活动记录，我们会依据SSG的标准对其进行审核，并在提交前弥补任何缺口。",
  "For our existing clients, consulting is always pro bono.": "对我们的现有客户而言，咨询始终是无偿的。",
  "For our existing clients, the consultation, an honest reading of TPQA and CQC readiness, and a gap analysis against SWDA's criteria are given without charge and without obligation. Deeper work is scoped and priced in writing, but the guidance that shows you where you stand is always ours to give.": "对我们的现有客户而言，咨询、对TPQA与CQC就绪情况的坦诚研判，以及一份对照SWDA标准的差距分析，均免费提供，且无任何义务。更深入的工作会以书面形式界定范围并定价，但为您指明所处位置的指引，始终是我们乐于奉上的。",
  "For training providers operating outside the SWDA framework who now need approved status to access SWDA funding, sectoral commissions, or government tenders.": "面向在SWDA框架之外运营、如今需要获批资格以获取SWDA资助、行业委约或政府招标的培训机构。",
