  "In November 2025, SWDA held its annual TPQA outreach with training providers from across the sector. 2birds was invited to speak on best practices in courseware development and pre-audit preparation.": "2025年11月，SWDA与来自全行业的培训机构举办了年度TPQA外展活动。2birds受邀就课件开发与审计前准备的最佳实践发言。",
