  "In practice, this means SWDA reads your documented procedures and your implementation evidence side by side. Where documents and practice do not match, the grade suffers.": "实际操作中，这意味着SWDA会把您书面记录的程序与您的执行证据并排审读。凡文件与实践不相符之处，评级便会受损。",
