  "Into filled cohorts": "化为报满的班级",
  "Is the first consultation chargeable?": "首次咨询收费吗？",
  "It begins with a scoping consultation, where a Partner or the Founder sits with you to confirm the course and its standing on the CASL. An Associate then drafts your courseware in full, a Partner reviews and improves the draft against SWDA standards, and the Founder gives the final sign-off before submission. When auditors raise queries, the Partner answers them and the Founder assesses the merit of each point raised. On approval, the Partner and Associate finalise every document, and the Creative Producer provides one artwork for your course advertisement in a digital format.": "它始于一次范围界定咨询，由一位合伙人或创始人与您一同坐下来，确认课程及其在CASL上的地位。随后由一位助理顾问完整起草您的课件，一位合伙人对照SWDA标准审阅并改进初稿，创始人则在提交前作最终核准。当审计员提出疑问时，合伙人予以答复，创始人则评估所提每一点的合理性。获批之后，合伙人与助理顾问敲定每一份文件，创意制作人则为您的课程广告提供一份数字格式的美术作品。",
  "It does now. The TPQA item on the management of marketing activities was updated with effect from 1 December 2025, so your claims, approvals and publishing records are read at assessment. Every campaign we build comes with its substantiation file already in order.": "如今确实会。TPQA中关于营销活动管理的项目已于2025年12月1日起更新，因此您的各项声称、批准与发布记录都会在评估时被审阅。我们打造的每一场活动，都附带一份早已整理妥当的佐证档案。",
  "It even reads the paperwork learners will touch, down to the learner contract each trainee signs. The application fee is $545 inclusive of GST, and it is not refunded if the application fails.": "它甚至会审读学员将会接触到的文书，细至每位学员签署的学员合约。申请费为$545（含GST），若申请未通过，恕不退还。",
  "It is a short conversation, around twenty minutes by phone or email, to understand the project, its timeline and the form of SWDA funding that suits the course. We will give you a candid view of whether it is work we should take on and what it is likely to cost. There is no charge and no obligation on either side.": "这是一次简短的交谈，通过电话或电子邮件进行，约二十分钟，旨在了解项目、其时间安排，以及适合该课程的SWDA资助形式。我们会坦诚地告诉您，这是否是我们应当承接的工作，以及大致的费用。双方均无需付费，亦无任何义务。",
  "It is never too late to aim far. Some of the best learners we have ever served started later than everyone else in the room.": "志向高远，永远不嫌太迟。我们所服务过的一些最出色的学员，起步都比课堂里所有人都晚。",
  "It is not. The first consultation, around twenty minutes by phone or email, is offered without charge and without obligation. Its purpose is to understand the project, its timeline and the form of SWDA funding that suits the course, and to give you a candid view of whether it is a project we should take on and what it is likely to cost.": "不收费。首次咨询约二十分钟，通过电话或电子邮件进行，不收取费用，亦无任何义务。其目的在于了解项目、其时间安排，以及适合该课程的SWDA资助形式，并坦诚地告诉您这是否是我们应当承接的项目，以及大致费用几何。",
  "It is plotted as a clear graph.": "它被画成一张清晰的曲线图。",
  "It is useful, but not required. Where you have an expert, we work with them. Where you do not, we pair the course with one from our own community, and we prepare the evidence SWDA expects about their qualifications.": "有用，但非必需。若您有专家，我们便与他们合作。若您没有，我们会从自己的社群中为课程配上一位，并准备SWDA所期望的、关于其资格的证据。",
  "It takes twenty-five quick questions, and there are no right answers. At the end you will see your own learning style, and how we would design a course around it.": "只需回答二十五道简短的问题，而且没有标准答案。结束时，您将看到自己的学习风格，以及我们会如何围绕它来设计一门课程。",
