  "KPIs are defined per programme, reviewed monthly, and escalated when they breach. Measure, review and respond becomes routine rather than annual. The same dashboard goes to the board and to the operations meeting.": "KPI按各课程分别设定，每月复审，一旦突破阈值即行上报。衡量、复审与回应成为常态，而非一年一度之举。同一份仪表盘既呈交董事会，也用于运营会议。",
  "Keep going. An honest reading beats a kind one.": "继续作答。一份坦诚的评判，胜过一份宽厚的评判。",
