  "May not be registered to the TAEPP framework. From 1 April 2026, AEs who wish to deliver SWDA-supported training must be on the National Adult Educator Registry.": "可能并未在TAEPP框架下注册。自2026年4月1日起，希望交付SWDA支持培训的AE，必须列于全国成人教育者注册名录。",
