  "Monday to Friday · 9am to 6pm": "周一至周五 · 上午9时至下午6时",
  "Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm, excluding public holidays.": "周一至周五，上午9时至下午6时，公共假期除外。",
  "Months of paperwork, read in full before it is sent.": "数月的文书工作，在寄出之前逐字通读。",
  "Most courses reach submission in six to ten weeks, depending on the funding route and how quickly we can sit with your subject-matter expert. SWDA's own review then takes its course. The proposal you sign names the schedule, and we keep to it.": "大多数课程在六至十周内达到提交阶段，具体取决于资助途径，以及我们能多快与您的主题专家坐下来商议。此后，SWDA自身的审查按其节奏进行。您所签署的提案会载明时间表，我们则严格遵守。",
  "Most enquiries fall into one of three forms. We fit the form to the project, not the project to the form.": "大多数咨询可归入三种形式之一。我们让形式契合项目，而非让项目迁就形式。",
  "Most new entrants underestimate the administrative cadence of a trading ATO. The funded course requires post-cohort filings within prescribed windows. The renewal cycle requires evidence accumulated over the preceding twelve months. The Adult Educator Registry requires upkeep as practitioners come and go. None of it is difficult work, but none of it forgives a lapse.": "大多数新进入者都低估了一家运营中的ATO在行政上的节奏。获资助的课程要求在规定窗口内完成开班后的申报。续期周期要求累积此前十二个月的证据。成人教育者注册名录要求随着实践者的来去而持续维护。这些都不是难做的工作，但没有一项容得下疏漏。",
  "Most of our work begins with one course.": "我们的大多数工作，都始于一门课程。",
  "Mostly hands-on practice.": "大部分时间都在动手实操。",
