  "National Youth Council / OAE Council": "National Youth Council / OAE Council",
  "Neil Fleming's 1987 model of four learning preferences, by seeing, by hearing, by reading and writing, and by doing. It shapes how we build courseware.": "Neil Fleming于1987年提出的四种学习偏好模型：通过看、通过听、通过读写，以及通过做。它塑造着我们构建课件的方式。",
  "New courses to submit, funding to maintain, audits to prepare for, and classes to fill. We assist with all of it, every day.": "有新课程要提交、有资助要维持、有审计要准备，还有班级要报满。这一切，我们每天都在协助。",
  "New to the sector's language? Every abbreviation on this site is spelt out in": "对本行业的术语还不熟悉？本网站上的每一个缩略语都逐一详解于",
  "No document leaves the firm on one person's judgement alone. Every course, submission and audit response is read twice before anyone outside the firm sees it.": "没有任何文件仅凭一人的判断便离开本公司。每一份课程、提交材料与审计答复，在本公司以外的任何人看到之前，都会经过两次审读。",
  "No one way of teaching fits everyone.": "没有一种教学方式适合所有人。",
  "No, and you should be wary of anyone who says otherwise. The grade rests with SWDA's assessors alone. What we can do, and have done, is close every gap the checklist can find, put the evidence in the order assessors expect, and prepare your team in the processes the interviews will cover. The two providers we have walked through TPQA both returned Grade 1.": "不能，而且对任何声称能够的人，您都应当警惕。评级仅由SWDA的评估员决定。我们能做、也已经做到的，是弥合核对清单所能找出的每一处缺口，将证据按评估员期望的顺序排列，并让您的团队熟习访谈将涉及的各项流程。我们陪伴走过TPQA的两家机构，都获得了一级评级。",
  "No.": "不。",
