  "Organisation Registration is the work of months, not days, and the $545 application fee is not returned to an applicant who fails. We manage the OR application from end to end on a single fixed-fee engagement, alongside the paired Course Application that SWDA requires to be submitted with it.": "机构注册是数月而非数日的工作，而$545的申请费不会退还给未通过的申请人。我们以单一固定费用的合作方式，从头到尾代为办理OR申请，连同SWDA要求随附提交的配套课程申请。",
