  "People take in new material differently. Some understand a diagram at a glance. Some need to talk an idea through. Some want the manual, and some just want to try it with their own hands. A course built for only one kind of learner quietly leaves the others behind.": "人们吸收新知的方式各不相同。有人一眼便看懂一张图。有人需要把一个想法讲出来才通透。有人想要手册，也有人只想亲手试一试。一门只为某一类学员而建的课程，会不动声色地把其余的人抛在后头。",
