  "PixPlaySG is our creative collaborator in front of the lens. Their focus is personal branding video for training providers, the kind that gives an ATO and its principal trainers the recognition they have earned. We plan it, PixPlaySG films it, and the provider publishes it, the way the guideline requires.": "PixPlaySG是我们镜头前的创意合作伙伴。他们专注于为培训机构制作个人品牌视频，让ATO及其主要培训师获得应得的认可。我们策划，PixPlaySG拍摄，再由机构按准则要求发布。",
