  "Read in this light, the assessment looks less like an annual cost and more like a five-year investment. The training providers we advise return to us because the year between assessments is the year in which an operation is quietly tightened, or quietly left to drift.": "如此看来，这项评估与其说是一年一度的成本，不如说更像一笔为期五年的投资。我们所辅导的培训机构一再回到我们身边，因为两次评估之间的那一年，正是一家运营被悄然收紧、或被悄然放任漂流的一年。",
