  "Revenue per learner, gross margin per course, enterprise repeat rate, and three-year retention of the AE roster. These are the metrics that determine whether the business survives the next change in funding.": "每名学员的营收、每门课程的毛利率、企业客户的复购率，以及AE名录的三年留存率。正是这些指标，决定了业务能否挺过下一次资助变动。",
