  "SWDA": "SWDA",
  "SWDA Audit Matters": "SWDA审计事务",
  "SWDA allows a review, requested within ten working days of the outcome, at a fee of $3,052 including GST, and only on narrow grounds, a failure of procedure, or findings that contradict the evidence examined. We assist you in judging honestly whether those grounds exist, and we draft the request if they do.": "SWDA允许在结果公布后十个工作日内申请复核，费用为$3,052（含GST），且仅限于狭窄的理由：程序上的失误，或与所审阅证据相矛盾的结论。我们协助您诚实地判断这些理由是否成立，若成立，则由我们起草申请。",
  "SWDA audit": "SWDA审计",
  "SWDA audits the training providers it funds, and a poor result can end your funding. We get your documents, your team and your day-to-day operation ready, months before the letter arrives.": "SWDA会审计其资助的培训机构，而不佳的结果可能终结您的资助。我们让您的文件、团队与日常运营在通知函到来的数月之前便准备就绪。",
  "SWDA checks its funded training providers in two ways. The first is the Training Provider Quality Assessment (TPQA), a review of your whole organisation, from how you handle learner feedback to how your board signs off on policy. The grade decides whether you keep full funding, partial funding, or lose your registered status altogether.": "SWDA以两种方式核查其资助的培训机构。第一种是培训机构质量评估（TPQA），对您整个机构的审视，从您如何处理学员反馈，到您的董事会如何核准政策。评级决定您是保留全额资助、部分资助，还是彻底失去注册资格。",
  "SWDA expects at least a year of regular training activity, with at least one course in every quarter, supported by structured evidence. If you are not there yet, that is not the end of the conversation. We plan the runway with you, what to run, how to document it, and when the application becomes viable.": "SWDA期望至少一年的常规培训活动，每个季度至少开办一门课程，并以结构化的证据佐证。若您尚未达到这一点，交谈并不会就此结束。我们会与您一同规划前路：开办什么、如何记录，以及何时申请方才可行。",
  "SWDA measures a training provider across three criteria and twelve items. Each item, done well, returns something measurable to the business, whether in learner retention, governance posture or enterprise standing. Score yourself below, or read the market best practice for each item.": "SWDA从三项标准、十二个项目来衡量一家培训机构。每个项目若做得好，都会为业务带来可衡量的回报，无论是在学员留存、治理姿态，还是企业声望方面。请在下方为自己评分，或阅读每个项目的市场最佳实践。",
  "SWDA notifies the provider, and the documents listed in the notification are furnished, including the following.": "SWDA通知机构，通知中所列的文件须予提供，包括以下各项。",
  "SWDA's Skills Demand for the Future Economy report organises Singapore's sectoral demand around three priority economies. Our community currently works within parts of each, and grows carefully, by invitation.": "SWDA的《未来经济技能需求》报告，将新加坡的行业需求围绕三大优先经济领域来梳理。我们的社群目前活跃于其中各领域的部分范畴，并以邀请制审慎地成长。",
  "SWDA's check of the courseware itself, as it is actually used in delivery. It sits alongside TPQA and is usually a document review.": "SWDA对课件本身的核查，即其在交付中实际使用的样子。它与TPQA并行，通常是一次文件审查。",
  "SWDA's online portal for training providers. Registration, course submissions, funding claims and audit correspondence all pass through it.": "SWDA面向培训机构的在线门户。注册、课程提交、资助申领与审计往来函件，全都经由它进行。",
  "SWDA's quality assessment of a funded training provider as a whole. The grade decides whether the provider keeps its funding.": "SWDA对一家获资助培训机构的整体质量评估。评级决定该机构能否保住其资助。",
  "SWDA's sector-by-sector map of job roles and the skills they require. WSQ courses are mapped to it.": "SWDA逐一行业绘制的职位角色及其所需技能的图谱。WSQ课程对应至它。",
  "SWDA's survey of learners after funded training. Weak scores raise the chance of a course being selected for review.": "SWDA在获资助培训之后对学员进行的调查。分数偏弱会提高课程被选中接受审查的几率。",
