  "Sectors built around sustainability, decarbonisation and the built environment. The framework here is younger, and our network of SMEs in this area is still being assembled.": "围绕可持续发展、去碳化与建筑环境而构建的行业。此处的框架较为年轻，我们在这一领域的SME网络仍在组建之中。",
  "Sectors driving the transition to data, cloud and AI. Skills are listed under the Course Approval Skills List (CASL) and qualify for the higher SWDA funding tier where eligible.": "推动向数据、云端与AI转型的行业。相关技能列于课程批准技能清单（CASL）之下，符合条件者可享更高一级的SWDA资助。",
  "Sectors that serve a growing and ageing population. Demand is steady and SWDA funding well-established for both WSQ and non-WSQ certifiable courses.": "服务于不断增长且日益老龄化人口的行业。需求稳定，SWDA对WSQ与非WSQ可认证课程的资助也都相当成熟。",
