  "Singapore's consumption tax. We are not GST-registered, so no GST is charged on our professional fees.": "新加坡的消费税。我们未登记GST，因此我们的专业服务费不收取GST。",
  "Singapore's data protection law, which governs how we collect and hold personal data. Our Privacy Policy sets out the detail.": "新加坡的数据保护法，规范我们如何收集与保存个人数据。我们的隐私政策载明其细节。",
  "Singapore's national credentialing system for workforce skills. WSQ courses are competency-based, examinable, and eligible for the higher tier of SWDA funding.": "新加坡面向劳动力技能的国家资历认证体系。WSQ课程以能力为本、可考核，并符合更高一级SWDA资助的资格。",
  "Singapore's registrar of companies. A training provider must first exist as a legal entity registered here, or with the Registry of Societies.": "新加坡的公司注册机构。培训机构必须首先作为在此注册的法律实体存在，或在社团注册局注册。",
  "Six places where the choice of practitioner matters, in handling rather than in slogans.": "六个真正体现实践者人选之重的环节，见于处理的手法，而非口号。",
  "Sketching it out where you can see it.": "把它画出来，摆在眼前看。",
  "Skills Framework": "技能框架",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency": "技能与劳动力发展局",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency (SWDA)": "技能与劳动力发展局（SWDA）",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency (SWDA) invited us to speak at its 2025 outreach on strengthening training quality through sound adult educator systems.": "技能与劳动力发展局（SWDA）邀请我们在其2025年外展活动上发言，主题为通过健全的成人教育者体系提升培训质量。",
  "Skills and Workforce Development Agency's 2025 guideline is clear. Under Information Memorandum QMD/2025/5, a registered training provider may not engage, request or procure any outside party to promote, advertise or market its courses. The public face of the courses stays with the provider.": "技能与劳动力发展局2025年的指引十分明确。根据资讯备忘录QMD/2025/5，注册培训机构不得聘用、要求或安排任何外部方来推广、宣传或营销其课程。课程面向公众的门面，须由机构自身持有。",
  "SkillsFuture Singapore": "新加坡技能创前程",
  "Skip to content": "跳至内容",
  "Slides and Learner Guide": "幻灯片与学员指南",
  "Small, senior, and answerable.": "小而精、资深，且负责到底。",
  "So every course we build offers more than one route to the same understanding. A learner can meet the material in the way that suits them, and a trainer never has to teach to the middle and hope the rest keep up.": "因此，我们构建的每一门课程，都提供不止一条通往同一理解的路径。学员可以用适合自己的方式接触教材，培训师也再不必迁就中游、寄望其余的人跟得上。",
  "So we build in narration, discussion and spoken walk-throughs, so the material can be heard as readily as it is read.": "所以我们加入旁白、讨论和口头的逐步讲解，让材料既能读，也一样能听。",
  "So we build practice, worked examples and hands-on tasks into the course, so the learning happens by doing.": "所以我们把练习、范例和动手的任务融入课程，让学习在实践中发生。",
  "So we hold ourselves to a simple promise. Dream as big as you like, and our job is to build the course that can actually take you there. A course should lift people up, never screen them out, and the height a learner reaches should be set by their own effort, never by carelessly made material.": "因此，我们以一个简单的承诺自守。尽管放胆去梦，而我们的职责，是构建一门真正能载您抵达那里的课程。课程应当托举人向上，而非把人筛除在外；学员所能抵达的高度，理应由他们自身的努力来决定，绝不应由草率制成的材料来决定。",
  "So we lead with diagrams, flow and clear layout, and let the structure of a course be visible at a glance.": "所以我们以图表、流程和清晰的排版开路，让一门课程的结构一眼就能看清。",
  "So we write courseware in plain, well-ordered prose, with notes, summaries and definitions that reward a careful reader.": "所以我们用平实、条理分明的文字来编写课件，配上笔记、摘要和定义，让用心的读者读有所得。",
